  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n[The HTML Parser spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#prescan-a-byte-stream-to-determine-its-encoding) depends on labels that are hard to implement in a language (Swift, Python etc) that do not support arbitrary labels within a function (e.g. goto).\r\n\r\nIt would be helpful if the specs could be rewritten to avoid these constructs to make it more straight forward to implement using only loops and if/else statements.",
